<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title>GitLab on 我的 Dream 博客</title><link>https://thomasChen9691.github.io/mapleFlow/tags/gitlab.html</link><description>Recent content in GitLab on 我的 Dream 博客</description><generator>Hugo -- 0.156.0</generator><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 28 Jan 2026 20:30:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://thomasChen9691.github.io/mapleFlow/tags/gitlab/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>运维工具 SOP 文档索引</title><link>https://thomasChen9691.github.io/mapleFlow/posts/sop-ops-tools-index.html</link><pubDate>Wed, 28 Jan 2026 20:30:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://thomasChen9691.github.io/mapleFlow/posts/sop-ops-tools-index.html</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;本索引汇总本站发布的运维工具标准操作规范（SOP）文章，便于在网页上按工具查阅安装、常用命令与日常操作流程。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
